<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Our times are in Thy hand:</l><l>Whatever they may be;</l><l>Pleasing or painful, dark or bright,</l><l>As best may seem to Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Our times are in Thy hand;</l><l>Why should we doubt or fear?</l><l>A father’s hand will never cause</l><l>His child a needless tear.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Our times are in Thy hand;</l><l>Jesus, the Crucified,</l><l>Whose hand our many sins have pierced,</l><l>Is now our guard and guide.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Our times are in Thy hand;</l><l>We’ll always trust to Thee,</l><l>Till we possess the promised crown,</l><l>And all Thy glory see.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
